      <manualTask name="Verify the resulting cancellation lifecycle, settlement and FAP booking state"
                   id="_007c6427-cc1d-4c75-8e2a-3502383ecd24"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_007c6427-cc1d-4c75-8e2a-3502383ecd24"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-002-004; CSP-SM-001-007; CSP-IO-005-006.
 
Input: Accepted cancellation processing result; current FAP booking state and applicable settlement or recovery state.
 
Handling: Confirm that the cancellation is the latest effective lifecycle event and that the resulting lifecycle, position, settlement and FAP states agree with the factual scenario. Retain all historical versions, instructions and postings. A completed settlement remains `SETTLED`; partial settlement or recovery remains separately visible.
 
Output: Confirmed cancellation state or identified lifecycle, settlement or booking-state discrepancy.]]></documentation>
