      <manualTask name="Place the cancellation under manual coordination"
                   id="_0e42f159-5380-47e4-b519-2e0693dcc4a6"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_0e42f159-5380-47e4-b519-2e0693dcc4a6"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-003-004; CSP-IO-007-008.
 
Input: Cancellation event for which settlement instructions already exist.
 
Handling: Record that the cancellation requires manual coordination, identify the affected settlement instructions and responsible teams, and prevent operational completion until the outcomes of both currency legs are known.
 
Output: Coordinated cancellation case ready for settlement-instruction review.]]></documentation>
