      <manualTask name="Update the operational tracker and complete the amendment outcome or route an exception"
                   id="_1506975e-b3a4-4860-b16c-bd3e31251a1b"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_1506975e-b3a4-4860-b16c-bd3e31251a1b"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-001; CSP-SM-007; CSP-IO-006-008.
 
Input: Verified amendment booking state and any applicable exception information.
 
Handling: Update the operational lifecycle tracker with the trade, version, processing outcome, lifecycle status, evidence, owner and next action. Confirm local completion or route any unresolved issue as an exception.
 
Output:  CSP-IO-007 operational lifecycle tracker update and either successful amendment completion or documented exception outcome.]]></documentation>
