      <manualTask name="Validate lifecycle identity, version sequence, current state and applicable cut-offs"
                   id="_176d7d97-b553-4f32-8fcd-f4022054af28"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_176d7d97-b553-4f32-8fcd-f4022054af28"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-001-004; CSP-SM-001-003; CSP-PP-004.
 
Input: Relevant lifecycle record from CSP-IO-001 and available current system states.
 
Handling: Confirm that `trade_id` exists, the incoming version is the next expected version, the prior version has the expected state, the event was not already processed, no later version exists, and relevant valuation, accounting, settlement and operational cut-offs permit processing.
 
Output: Lifecycle event valid for AMEND or CANCEL processing, or failed validation details for CSP-IO-008.
 ]]></documentation>
