      <manualTask name="Identify both settlement instructions and attempt to stop or recall each one"
                   id="_20d5224c-77ed-48ab-8327-ce94e23b167d"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_20d5224c-77ed-48ab-8327-ce94e23b167d"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-003-004; CSP-ST-005; CSP-ST-007; CSP-SM-006.
 
Input: Cancellation event and available settlement-instruction information.
 
Handling: Identify the separate instruction for each currency leg, verify its current status and independently attempt cancellation, stopping or recall where operationally possible. Preserve the original instruction identifiers and status history.
 
Output: Available stop, recall or settlement result for each expected leg.]]></documentation>
