      <manualTask name="Investigate and correct the amendment FAP import file-control exception"
                   id="_3147b278-1ae2-44c8-b958-aefa79f3a4ae"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_3147b278-1ae2-44c8-b958-aefa79f3a4ae"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-IO-008.
 
Input: Documented amendment import-file control exception.
 
Handling: Investigate the relevant template, mapping, format, population or control-total issue and correct the file where possible. Retain evidence of the investigation and correction.
 
Output: Corrected amendment FAP import file for renewed preparation and control, or documented unresolved outcome.]]></documentation>
