         <documentation id="documentation_32a0f3f1-34d6-4bab-abb9-3eeb46c73488"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-SM-001-007; CSP-IO-008.
 
Input: Documented cancellation state exception.
 
Handling: Compare the processing result with lifecycle, settlement, recovery and FAP evidence, determine the cause of the discrepancy and coordinate the correction or clarification. Because the record was already accepted, resolution returns to state verification rather than resubmission.
 
Output: Resolved state available for renewed verification or documented unresolved outcome.]]></documentation>
