      <manualTask name="Update the operational tracker and complete the cancellation outcome or route an exception"
                   id="_3613f4b5-e024-44a4-98f1-28042074010f"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_3613f4b5-e024-44a4-98f1-28042074010f"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-002-004; CSP-SM-007; CSP-IO-006-008.
 
Input: Verified cancellation, settlement and FAP states and any applicable exception information.
 
Handling: Update the operational lifecycle tracker with the trade, version, cancellation status, settlement or recovery status, processing evidence, owner and next action. Confirm local completion or route any unresolved issue as an exception.
 
Output: CSP-IO-007 operational lifecycle tracker update and either successful cancellation completion or documented exception outcome.]]></documentation>
