      <manualTask name="Transform and control the amended lifecycle record using approved template and mappings"
                   id="_3d7fc5c5-55d6-4d56-ae9b-2e3f48c888de"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_3d7fc5c5-55d6-4d56-ae9b-2e3f48c888de"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-001; CSP-IO-001-003.
 
Input: Validated AMEND event, approved FAP import template and approved mapping and reference rules.
 
Handling: Preserve source identifiers, map the amended economics and lifecycle information, apply the required formats and permitted values, and control the transformed record against the approved references.
 
Output: Controlled amendment record ready for import-file preparation.]]></documentation>
