      <manualTask name="Coordinate the cancellation lifecycle impact and recovery requirement"
                   id="_4f4a78f5-a0de-4c50-8a29-4e018b73e685"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_4f4a78f5-a0de-4c50-8a29-4e018b73e685"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-004; CSP-PR-008; CSP-IO-007-008.
 
Input: Actual settlement-leg outcomes and separate recovery requirement.
 
Handling: Determine the resulting trade-level lifecycle impact, coordinate the participating operational teams, record recovery ownership and ensure the lifecycle tracker distinguishes cancellation processing from settlement recovery.
 
Output: Coordinated lifecycle and recovery status for accounting and reconciliation assessment.]]></documentation>
