      <manualTask name="Investigate and correct the lifecycle validation exception"
                   id="_590f2bbd-d0d0-4c3b-bbae-0a76259a268a"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_590f2bbd-d0d0-4c3b-bbae-0a76259a268a"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-PP-004; CSP-IO-008.
 
Input: Documented lifecycle validation exception.
 
Handling: Investigate the source event, version sequence, prior lifecycle state, duplication risk and relevant cut-offs. Obtain a corrected event or clarification where possible; otherwise document the unresolved outcome and required next action.
 
Output: Corrected lifecycle event for complete revalidation, or updated unresolved exception evidence.]]></documentation>
