         <documentation id="documentation_5b172b96-f2bd-4057-92d7-fe18a8088227"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-004; CSP-AC-002; CSP-SM-006.
 
Input: Actual settlement outcomes, cash-recovery status and current accounting postings.
 
Handling: Assess whether existing postings require reversal, reclassification, correction or another controlled adjustment. Preserve historical postings and distinguish completed settlement from pending recovery.
 
Output: No adjustment required, defined accounting-adjustment requirement or escalated accounting exception.]]></documentation>
