      <manualTask name="Assess and record settlement-related breaks"
                   id="_71aef29e-9bb7-45df-8ab4-530de059512e"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_71aef29e-9bb7-45df-8ab4-530de059512e"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-004; CSP-RC-002-005.
 
Input: Actual leg outcomes, lifecycle state, FAP information and recovery evidence.
 
Handling: Identify and classify settlement-related missing records, data mismatches, status mismatches or timing differences. Record the break status, owner, evidence, expected resolution and required recovery action.
 
Output: Updated reconciliation-break record or confirmation that no unresolved break remains.]]></documentation>
