      <manualTask name="Assess the cancellation scenario and affected downstream state"
                   id="_73ec88d3-dc40-4188-9d7e-988d303886a8"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_73ec88d3-dc40-4188-9d7e-988d303886a8"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-002-004; CSP-SM-003; CSP-PP-004.
 
Input: Validated CANCEL event and available valuation, accounting, settlement and FAP states.
 
Handling: Determine whether settlement instructions exist and assess the downstream activity already performed, relevant operational cut-offs and affected control owners.
 
Output: Cancellation routed to the applicable pre-instruction or settlement-instruction scenario.]]></documentation>
