      <manualTask name="Record both instruction outcomes and confirm cancellation coordination"
                   id="_9ebdc845-fcbd-4879-9c67-7b40aab874e9"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_9ebdc845-fcbd-4879-9c67-7b40aab874e9"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-003; CSP-ST-006; CSP-SM-006.
 
Input: Confirmed outcome of both settlement instructions where both were stopped before either leg settled.
 
Handling: Record both instruction results and confirm that neither leg produced a completed cash settlement requiring separate recovery. Retain the original identifiers and status evidence.
 
Output: Confirmed settlement-coordination outcome permitting cancellation processing to continue.
 
 ]]></documentation>
