      <manualTask name="Document and route the amendment booking-state exception"
                   id="_a40dbce3-591f-4d14-b9c0-1336d0201a34"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_a40dbce3-591f-4d14-b9c0-1336d0201a34"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-008; CSP-LC-001; CSP-SM-007; CSP-IO-006; CSP-IO-008.
 
Input: Discrepancy between the accepted amendment processing result and resulting FAP booking state.
 
Handling: Record the expected and observed versions and states, supporting evidence, assigned owner, current status and required investigation.
 
Output: Amendment booking-state exception routed to the assigned owner.]]></documentation>
