      <manualTask name="Investigate the amendment booking-state exception"
                   id="_a4eff719-bc75-4f4b-b4b1-13aaf21ae48e"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_a4eff719-bc75-4f4b-b4b1-13aaf21ae48e"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-SM-001-007; CSP-IO-008.
 
Input: Documented amendment booking-state exception.
 
Handling: Compare the processing result, current FAP state and lifecycle history, determine the cause of the discrepancy and coordinate correction or clarification. Because the record was already accepted, resolution returns to state verification rather than resubmission.
 
Output: Resolved state available for renewed verification or documented unresolved outcome.]]></documentation>
