      <manualTask name="Investigate and correct the rejected cancellation record"
                   id="_cad589fb-a0b1-4120-856d-9119b0e76da7"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_cad589fb-a0b1-4120-856d-9119b0e76da7"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-IO-008.
 
Input: Documented rejected cancellation record and available processing evidence.
 
Handling: Investigate the rejection, correct the affected cancellation record where possible and retain evidence of the change. Records already accepted by SYS-FAP are not included in the corrected resubmission.
 
Output: Corrected cancellation record for renewed transformation or documented unresolved outcome.]]></documentation>
