      <manualTask name="Investigate and correct the rejected amendment record"
                   id="_e48bf870-a11c-4094-8020-e72cc43573f1"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_e48bf870-a11c-4094-8020-e72cc43573f1"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-008; CSP-RC-005; CSP-IO-008.
 
Input: Documented rejected amendment record and available processing evidence.
 
Handling: Investigate the rejection, correct the affected amendment record where possible and retain evidence of the change. Records already accepted by SYS-FAP are not included in the corrected resubmission.
 
Output: Corrected amendment record for renewed transformation or documented unresolved outcome.]]></documentation>
