      <manualTask name="Record actual leg outcomes and initiate separate recovery"
                   id="_f027d11e-434a-4da5-8b88-085b81f1da36"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_f027d11e-434a-4da5-8b88-085b81f1da36"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-LC-004; CSP-ST-007; CSP-SM-003; CSP-SM-006.
 
Input: Settlement scenario in which one or both instructions could not be stopped or cash already settled.
 
Handling: Record the actual result of each original leg and initiate a separate recall, cash-recovery or compensating-payment process where required. A completed settlement remains `SETTLED` and is not overwritten as `CANCELLED`.
 
Output: Known leg outcomes and documented recovery requirement, including `PARTIALLY_SETTLED` or `RECOVERY_PENDING` where applicable.]]></documentation>
