      <manualTask name="Document and route the cancellation state exception"
                   id="_fe022928-4673-47a2-a561-99cbaa5a4a59"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_fe022928-4673-47a2-a561-99cbaa5a4a59"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-008; CSP-LC-002-004; CSP-SM-007; CSP-IO-006; CSP-IO-008.
 
Input: Discrepancy between the accepted cancellation result and the resulting lifecycle, settlement or FAP state.
 
Handling: Record the expected and observed states, affected identifiers, supporting evidence, assigned owner, current status and required investigation.
 
Output: Cancellation state exception routed to the assigned owner.]]></documentation>
